      "title": "UK to give support to Saudi jets in attempt to counter Houthi fighters",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/21/uk-to-give-support-to-saudi-jets-in-attempt-to-counter-houthi-fighters",
      "description": "<p>Andy Burnham seeks stability in Middle East to bring down prices at home as first meeting with Trump looms</p><p>The UK has agreed to provide defensive air support to Saudi Arabia to help counter Houthi fighters and restore stability in the Middle East while driving down the cost of living at home, Andy Burnham has said, ahead of his first meeting with Donald Trump.</p><p>The prime minister said he had agreed to a request for air-to-air refuelling of Saudi jets to defend energy infrastructure against the Iran-backed rebels and help keep oil flowing from the Gulf to ease global economic turmoil.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/21/uk-to-give-support-to-saudi-jets-in-attempt-to-counter-houthi-fighters\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
